                                                        class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-full">★</span><span
                                                        class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-half">★</span>
                                                </div>
                                                <i class="fa-solid fa-heart favorite-heart" title="Favorited"></i>
                                            </div>

                                            <div class="review-author-line">
                                                <a href="/profile" class="review-avatar-link">
                                                    <img src="assets/avatars/shehab.jpg" alt="Shehab"
                                                        class="review-micro-avatar"
                                                        onerror="this.src='assets/profile-avatar.jpg'">
                                                </a>
                                                <a href="/profile" class="review-author-username">@Shehab_Aboshady</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="header-right-stack"></div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="minimal-card-body">
                                    <p class="review-body"
                                        data-full-text="Absolute cinematic masterpiece. The pacing is phenomenal, and Antony Starr deserves all the awards for his performance as Homelander. I can't wait for the next season! The way they handle modern superhero tropes is just brilliant. It completely subverts expectations while keeping you on the edge of your seat.">
                                        Absolute cinematic masterpiece. The pacing is phenomenal, and Antony Starr
                                        deserves
                                        all the awards for his performance as Homelander. I can't wait for the next
                                        season!
                                        The way they handle modern superhero tropes is just brilliant. It completely
                                        subverts expectations while keeping you on the edge of your seat.
                                    </p>
                                </div>

                                <div class="minimal-card-footer">
                                    <div class="minimal-actions">
                                        <button class="minimal-btn review-like-btn" title="Like Review">
                                            <i class="fa-regular fa-heart"></i> <span>1.2k</span>
                                        </button>
                                        <a href="/single-review" class="minimal-btn"><i
                                                class="fa-regular fa-comment"></i> 84</a>
                                    </div>
                                    <a href=".//single-review" class="minimal-read-link">Read More <i
                                            class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i></a>
                                </div>
                            </article>

                            <hr class="review-divider">

                            <article class="minimal-review-card">
                                <div class="minimal-card-header">
                                    <div class="header-left-stack">
                                        <a href="/details" class="review-poster-link" title="Spider-Man">
