                                                </a>
                                                <a href="/profile" class="review-author-username">@Shehab_Aboshady</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="header-right-stack">
                                        <span class="spoiler-badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i>
                                            Spoiler</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="minimal-card-body">
                                    <p class="review-body blurred" onclick="revealSpoiler(this)"
                                        data-full-text="The ending left me completely speechless! The animation and the music are pure perfection.">
                                        The ending left me completely speechless! The animation and the music are pure
